  "details": "Any of my worlds and concerts using the VRCMIDI player is not working and a udonbehavior crashes when its trying to start a MIDI player. Easy way to confirm is by going to UASRF, hit play on any level, if the music does not start when opening the first door then it has crashed and the weapon wont fire. the crash is logged as well.\n\nAffected worlds:\n\nUASRF: wrld_dd9d5e27-ec2f-4cc0-864e-ed5b622ad406\n\nDuoBeat: wrld_ebc06158-da47-4454-ba65-8e3248bd3bef\n\nIridescence: wrld_c6db3f02-d2c8-406c-a808-c5b53be0cc7e\n\nRefulgent: wrld_f17af36e-3f95-4602-8888-993ffc3e3e48",
